th challenges.\n\nfeat(mcp): implement Model Context Protocol (MCP) infrastructure\n\n- Created MCP module with request handler, server factory, transport factory, and schema registry.\n- Developed ToolRegistry to manage MCP tools and their execution.\n- Added McpPrincipal class to represent the authenticated principal in MCP requests.\n- Implemented validation and error handling for tool inputs and outputs.\n- Introduced utility functions for tool result formatting and error normalization.\n\nfix(database): improve filter processor for UUID handling\n\n- Enhanced buildSearch method to skip UUID columns during search operations.\n- Added utility function to identify UUID columns.\n\nchore: add zod as a subpath for consistent schema validation\n\n- Re-exported zod to ensure MCP tool schemas use the same instance for validation.","tree":{"sha":"c7c66a755df786cb777c220014b84912e4c18bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/api-sdk/git/trees/c7c66a755df786cb777c220014b84912e4c18bf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/api-sdk/git/commits/3b63c09af7075a797c2adbb6a127e7315d966418","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125557277?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyamsunder99","id":125557277,"login":"shyamsunder99","node_id":"U_kgDOB3vaHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"