}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/api-sdk/commits/aa08d82a4bd69b658bcd2ab66d5133de28d08957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T05:39:35Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T05:39:35Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"message":"feat: add user feature resolution and catalog types\n\n- Implemented `resolveUserFeatures` function to determine user-visible features based on business unit and role grants.\n- Created new types for user features, permissions, and catalog entries in `types.ts`.\n- Added filtering logic for granted permissions and their lock states.\n- Introduced `pickRouteForPlatform` to select appropriate microfrontend routes based on client platform.\n\nfeat: introduce email module for transactional emails\n\n- Added `EmailModule` and `EmailService` for handling Brevo-backed transactional emails.\n\nfeat: add license module for catalog and entitlement management\n\n- Implemented functions for canonical JSON serialization and hashing in `canonical.ts`.\n- Created signing and verification functions for Ed25519-signed documents in `signing.ts`.\n- Added tests for canonical serialization and signing/verification logic.\n\nfeat: enhance money module with currency handling\n\n- Introduced `CurrencyAmountDto` for managing currency values.\n- Added currency validation decorators for ensuring correct currency codes and amounts.\n- Implemented major/minor currency conversion logic with validation exceptions.\n\nrefactor: reorganize module exports for clarity\n\n- Moved various modules to their respective subpaths to improve structure and avoid unnecessary dependencies in the main barrel.\n- Updated `tsup.config.ts` to reflect new entry points for ca