e-domain, cookie-name, refresh-token-cookie, session-data, and user-id files for better readability.\n- Enhanced the `generateAccessToken` method in TokenService by improving object structure for clarity.\n- Updated the `getCurrentState` method in DataTableStateService to use multi-line parameters for better readability.\n- Refactored controller methods in DataTableViewsController to use multi-line parameters for clarity.\n- Added new `IsCurrency` decorator and `CurrencyAmountDto` class for currency validation.\n- Cleaned up imports and exports across various files for consistency and organization.\n- Improved formatting in filter.processor.ts and primary-base.repository.ts for better readability.\n- Added support for currency handling in phone.utils.ts and updated the xlsx export utility.\n- Enhanced NATS client module and decorators for better structure and readability.","tree":{"sha":"c5e95a17287bbe523897f2d61726cf8767689b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/api-sdk/git/trees/c5e95a17287bbe523897f2d61726cf8767689b9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/api-sdk/git/commits/45aa714ccf65f3537018dbbe641581d298f84bea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220210489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashank-vritti","id":220210489,"login":"shashank-vritti","node_id":"U_kgDODSAlOQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com