wODk0MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duremaar/chalix-mfe-authoring/commits/915bd559e05eea6438ef94b646dc45df54e5c5da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-04T16:46:39Z","email":"navin@opencraft.com","name":"Navin Karkera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-04T16:46:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: disable drag handles for children of library imported containers in course outline [FC-0097] (#2311)\n\n* Hides/disables drag handles for children components of containers imported from library.\n* Disables move, delete and duplicate options for children components.\n* Move up and down option skips containers that cannot accept children (imported from library).\n* Authors cannot drag and drop xblocks under containers imported from library.\n* Improves drag-n-drop by creating a representational drag overlay.","tree":{"sha":"9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duremaar/chalix-mfe-authoring/git/trees/9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duremaar/chalix-mfe-authoring/git/commits/915bd559e05eea6438ef94b646dc45df54e5c5da","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972\nparent 00ce3d78568375c42804932bc6c84c43ec8dbd55\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1754325999 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1754325999 -0500\n\nfeat: disable drag handles for children of library imported containers in course outline [FC-0097] (#2311)\n\n* Hides/disables drag handles for children components of containers imported from library.\n* Disables move, delete and duplicate options for children components.\n* Move up and down option skips containers that cannot accept children (imported from library).\n* Authors cannot drag and drop xblocks under containers imported from library.\n* Improves drag-n-drop by creating a representational drag overlay. ","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJokOPvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9VgQAAbPbiY76pjXfF0KQ4rSYLIJ\naf4PB5kSgVE7TloE3vEFehDzczRcL7JMniUbknx8b0l54tKMCP/DZxSI7ZTn/Gwc\n2U1+qXZfhuGECXY5OYBBgvUUyycl4g39nGncieb56+WHa5waw7IaK2yhmHHdqMSQ\nT0XmZC3RVkT3axNaRYGNMevcx30hCiEjQCZQ2l4gblsOCYBqEZW+TyJnGhc1isoN\nGYcLzHfot++Jxd1CiyEk4TFRaN2rOmts1oyqp7XUb0Gv9ciLceQn0kvQb75+wO1u\naDOm/j3BEED83/SsOCW/HnkogSXXBYpU5rrIWrdFJirwb8FD++OzmI955eIL4grl\nm/DbXWvjBaGw513OZH/HkmKEWGg3xM/Xpjr5bWolTNXaSoJ/RTBYoCh7li7CxuCv\n0p6RkhqxG0iEltQxYPeZTn0SBkQ7AFTFF1RV/G0njqRBB6Ja6B2g/geTxZpORs+q\nnnCHiqWIQ5Jhf2X716CShRhoj69USvinQrGhxbNyt8ZmsSjRfggd9WrvHV0FGPFs\nlFOsajBD7BWovxNB3t66qNKqlJ/gisQAjgCg6g8lUTfeuZ+wdrBA4Vmu/RCObKzF\nHiQ3ziKyc+jP+R3r63OrFDHws/llagOsSb2qllFZwr+d8xXE5pp7Gp0OO/jnvYVb\nS3pnk0VArswrV79/dTae\n=isQD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-26T17:52:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u