eCell, LastAccessedCell, ActionsCell) in CourseDetails.jsx for better separation of concerns.\n- Updated prop types for CourseDetails to ensure type safety.\n- Enhanced CourseSidebar.jsx by restructuring CourseCard component and improving the layout for better user experience.\n- Added prop types for CourseSidebar to validate data structure.\n- Refactored CourseUnitDetailModal.jsx to include prop types for better type checking.\n- Optimized CourseUnits.jsx by using useCallback for fetchCourseUnits and improved the search functionality.\n- Cleaned up EmotionRecognition.jsx and LearningOverview.jsx for better code clarity.\n- Introduced DebugCourseCard component for debugging purposes, logging relevant course data.","tree":{"sha":"0035c3fa101cbdbffe9b68eea282fa23c6509842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duremaar/chalix-mfe-learner-dashboard/git/trees/0035c3fa101cbdbffe9b68eea282fa23c6509842"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duremaar/chalix-mfe-learner-dashboard/git/commits/ceef604a0ddef4ba88465043264174d448f453c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33054551?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dungdl","id":33054551,"login":"dungdl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDU0NTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dungdl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"